<title>USA: Fannie Mae sets about $384 mln REMIC 1997-44.</title>
<headline>Fannie Mae sets about $384 mln REMIC 1997-44.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fannie Mae on Monday said it issued $384.4 million of Real Estate Mortgage Investment Conduit (REMIC) securities via Nomura Securities.</p>
<p>REMIC trust 1997-44 is backed by 30-year, 7.5 percent mortgage-backed certificates and various FNMA and Government National Mortgage Association (Ginnie Mae) REMIC tranches, it said.</p>
<p>The has a settlement date of June 30, the agency said.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
